Agent Governor NG documentation paths
-------------------------------------

Source-tree references such as `docs/deployment.md` are installed flat under
`/usr/share/doc/agent-governor-ng/`; read the corresponding
`/usr/share/doc/agent-governor-ng/deployment.md` file. The systemd deployment
contract is installed as `systemd-deployment.md` to avoid a README basename
collision. Configuration examples are uncompressed under the `examples/`
subdirectory and are inert until copied, site-enrolled, and reviewed.
